   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Basbudget st&#xf6;d till International Federation of Human Rights som &#xe4;r   en federation av 178 MR organisationer fr&#xe5;n drygt 100 l&#xe4;nder.         Organisationen verkar f&#xf6;r MR-f&#xf6;rsvarare, kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter, mot    straffrihet och utveckling av r&#xe4;ttstaten mm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding to International Federation of Human Rights (FIDH). FIDH is a federation of 178 non-governmental human rights organisations    from over 100 countries and works to promote and protect human rights FIDH focuses on human rights defenders, womens rights, impunity and   rule of law including the International Criminal Court, the           protection of migrants and refugees.</narrative>
